@startuml
actor User as U
participant CLI
participant discover_commands
participant bootstrap_module as Bootstrap
participant planning_repo as PlanningRepo

U -> CLI: sirius bootstrap
CLI -> discover_commands: discover_commands()
discover_commands --> CLI: CommandSpec list
CLI -> Bootstrap: load module & call main()
Bootstrap -> PlanningRepo: ensure_registry() / write_metadata
Bootstrap --> CLI: exit code
CLI --> U: return status
@enduml
